Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:09.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《黑镜》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.94,0:00:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 利亚姆·福克斯韦尔 欢迎 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Liam Foxwell, welcome. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我有点话要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, little speech time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.96,0:00:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对每一个被评估的人都说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've mentioned this to everyone about their appraisals,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.76,0:00:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你也明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I just want you to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.82,0:00:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,评估不是对冗余人员的迫害\N{\fnArial\fs30}this isn't a witch-hunt for the deadwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.44,0:00:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,它更像是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is much more of a…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.48,0:00:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,淘金\N{\fnArial\fs30}treasure hunt for the gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.33,0:00:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏东西沉下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit sinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但同时 精华浮上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But also, cream floats.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, I see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.24,0:00:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在开拓的新领域\N{\fnArial\fs30}A new the area we're getting lots of play in …
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.02,0:00:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时也是你将负责的主要工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your office could be at the centre for …
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.46,0:00:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那些过往的关于父母教育问题的诉讼\N{\fnArial\fs30}is litigation in retrospective parenting cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,过往的父母教育问题诉讼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retrospective…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.18,0:00:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 警察状告父母 因为他们对管教孩子不上心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby sues Mum and Dad for insufficient attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:00:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会导致自信缺乏 收入困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}leading to lack of confidence, leading to damages against earnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.82,0:01:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没问题 公司也安排好了吗？我是说在伦理上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, and we're OK, the firm's OK with that, ethically?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.84,0:01:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,和道德上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And morally?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.99,0:01:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.03,0:01:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.48,0:01:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 是 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.48,0:01:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.25,0:01:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.28,0:01:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.85,0:01:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 利亚姆 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, Liam, look,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.45,0:01:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们邀请你加入我们在新环境中的公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}so if we invite you to stay with the firm in the new environment,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.86,0:01:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你做一个关于你个人的详尽的回放\N{\fnArial\fs30}what we'd have you do is pull an exhaustive redo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.27,0:01:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能 就在下周\N{\fnArial\fs30}with personnel, maybe… next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.62,0:01:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就能做详细回放 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was ready to do a big redo right now, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 下周吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's fine, next week's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.10,0:01:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我需要知道的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have to ask you this …
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.57,0:01:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要放心他们不会做出\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're not going to hit anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.84,0:01:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么很出格的事 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to freak us out, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.41,0:01:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这一季度里没有对记忆进行重大删除吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no major deletions this quarter?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.68,0:01:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有没有 都在可删除的参数范围以内\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, everything's well within… parameters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.52,0:01:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 利亚姆 这真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, OK, Liam, this has been really great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.12,0:01:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,真心希望 期待着再次见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, really hope to… look forward to seeing you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.88,0:02:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.40,0:02:11.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,《你的人生》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.00,0:02:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,去机场 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Airport, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.36,0:02:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,活着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.96,0:02:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}breathe…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.23,0:02:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,附有气味的\N{\fnArial\fs30}smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.32,0:02:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,全面光谱记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full-spectrum memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.71,0:02:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你可以升级你的记忆芯片\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can get a willow grain upgrade for less than the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.77,0:02:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,比买一杯咖啡更优惠的价格\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a daily cup of coffee,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.92,0:02:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,享受三十年免费售后服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}and three decades of backup for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.17,0:02:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,局部麻醉后 再牢固的镶嵌进体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}In-store ingrain procedure with local anaesthetic…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.14,0:02:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就能轻松离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.94,0:02:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为记忆是为了生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because memory is for living.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.30,0:03:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 利亚姆 这真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, great, this has been really great, Liam,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.72,0:03:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,真心希望 期待能再次见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}we really hope to… look forward to seeing you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.52,0:03:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,真心希望 期待能再次见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We really hope to… look forward to seeing you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.52,0:03:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.18,0:03:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,福克斯韦尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Foxwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.68,0:03:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能回放你最近24小时的记录吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you just rewind me your last 24 hours for me, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.36,0:04:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 请用64倍速回放一周的景象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, and back that up for me times 64 for the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.82,0:04:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅途愉快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy your flight, Mr Foxwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.72,0:04:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是在说笑 好吧？但你看那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not being funny, right, but look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.18,0:04:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.02,0:04:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个！磨损了的地毯 那儿 看见没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That! Frayed carpet, there, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.43,0:04:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是认真的吗？- 是 认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seriously? - Yes, seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.80,0:04:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个五星级套房！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a five-star suite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.21,0:04:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我花了这么多钱 就应该有完美的细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pay good money to have perfect details.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.80,0:04:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 这破地毯将会伴随着我一生的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I've got that shitty carpet for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.48,0:04:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你一直盯着它的话就会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only if you keep looking at it, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.95,0:04:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是谢谢你 乔纳斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Jonas!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.87,0:04:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚吧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.08,0:04:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 现在你觉得这地毯糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, now, you thought the carpet was bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.18,0:04:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但再看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}have a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.01,0:04:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经见过露西了 在都柏林的婚礼上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've met Lucy, my wife, at the Dublin wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.68,0:04:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 嗨 利亚姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, yes, hi, Liam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.95,0:05:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,再嗨一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi… Hi again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.17,0:05:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.61,0:05:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西 我是利亚姆 在都柏林的婚礼上见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucy … Liam, we met at the Dublin wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.30,0:05:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,利亚姆！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liam!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.60,0:05:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.20,0:05:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 利亚姆 对 请进 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Liam, yes. Come in. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.22,0:05:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很高兴再次见到你 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Great to see you again. - Yeah, you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.60,0:05:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,斐在哪？她躲着你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Fi been hiding you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.12,0:05:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 她在家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, in our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.07,0:05:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't know … well,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.57,0:05:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不知道你到底能不能来\N{\fnArial\fs30}she didn't know if you would make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.27,0:05:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,它结束得比我想象的早\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was over quicker than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.03,0:05:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 你好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝点什么？啤酒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you a drink. Beer OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.95,0:05:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.68,0:05:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都在那边 我一会就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's through there, so I'll be in in a minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.93,0:05:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吗？- 好的 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK? - OK, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你提前回来了 我还以为你来不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're back early, then, I didn't think you'd make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.86,0:06:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我没留下来过夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I didn't stay over…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.26,0:06:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,搭了早一点的班机 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I caught an early flight back, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.54,0:06:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.19,0:06:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你的评估怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how was the appraisal?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.77,0:06:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说要我做一个回放 在下周 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they said they'd let me do a redo sometime next week, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.58,0:06:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们对你评价很好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But good?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.50,0:06:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.27,0:06:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 稍后再说？- 稍后再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Later? - Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.87,0:06:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,小宝贝朱迪怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's Jody?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.53,0:06:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在家 吉娜在照看她\N{\fnArial\fs30}At home, Gina's babysitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.29,0:06:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔纳斯 这位是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonas, this is…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.45,0:06:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我叫利亚姆 - 我是乔纳斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Liam … - Jonas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.45,0:06:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, it's really nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.48,0:06:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好吗？- 很好 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right? - Good, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.68,0:06:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你认识杰夫的 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you know Jeff? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.37,0:06:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会记得我和杰夫是因为他给你看过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you remember meeting Jeff, because he'd have shown you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.49,0:06:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于他电冰箱的侧面的一个回放\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, a redo of the side of his fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 滚远点 乔纳斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, yeah, piss off, Jonas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.51,0:06:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.82,0:06:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妻子今晚对我坏极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife's being very mean to me tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一向如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well she's like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.20,0:06:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.07,0:06:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还要酒吗？- 不用了 谢谢 乔纳斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right for a drink? - I'm fine, thank you, Jonas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.02,0:06:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,林恩 过来见见利亚姆 他是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lynn, come and meet Liam, he's…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.84,0:07:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个马上就没人雇也不值得雇的律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}A soon-to-be unemployed/unemployable lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.28,0:07:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是杰夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫和斐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeff and Fi…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.20,0:07:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去经常跟我和保罗一起在弗雷泽开派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}used to run the parties down the Fraser Road with Paul and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.90,0:07:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯狂的旧时光啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mad old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.26,0:07:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是在我们创办Kings以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before we started up the Kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.32,0:07:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, yeah…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.72,0:07:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那利亚姆 你是去了一个估价会议？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Liam, what was it you had, an assessment?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.65,0:07:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,评估会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Appraisal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.24,0:07:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.76,0:07:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 简直是个灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it was a disaster,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.36,0:07:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道 我也不知道结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you know, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.89,0:07:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 难以揣测？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hard to gauge? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.24,0:07:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那展示给我们看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.60,0:07:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,回放 我们可以评估一下他们的评估\N{\fnArial\fs30}Redo, we can appraise the appraisal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.96,0:07:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.40,0:07:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,投影到那上面 我们来给你评分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw it up there and we can grade you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.74,0:07:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.57,0:07:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会很有趣 我们可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be fun, we could…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.69,0:07:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,投票！\N{\fnArial\fs30}vote!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.52,0:07:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 保罗 - 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Paul? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.96,0:07:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在招募处工作 所以我的意见或许有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I work in recruitment, so it might be quite useful for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.99,0:07:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.60,0:07:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,利亚姆准备回放他的评估会 我们来给他打分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liam's redoing his appraisal so we can give him marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.40,0:07:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 作批注 - 给指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Notes. - Pointers, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.41,0:08:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想利亚姆可能 - 是 你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think Liam would probably… - Yes, do you know what…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.68,0:08:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家 别这样 说真的 这不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, no, come on, seriously, that's not cool,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.85,0:08:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 利亚姆明显觉得这不太舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean Liam's obviously uncomfortable,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.32,0:08:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我们别提它了 行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}so let's just drop it, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.60,0:08:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你玩得愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a cool time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.80,0:08:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,该吃饭了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.12,0:08:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,饭已经好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.38,0:08:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你邀请我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much for inviting us this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.84,0:08:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久没聚过了 好久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been too long, too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.17,0:08:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,斐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.64,0:08:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔纳斯 我以前没见过他 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't met him before, have I? Jonas, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.43,0:08:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是原来的老朋友之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's one of the old crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.28,0:08:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我已经告诉过你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.07,0:08:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧？- 挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You OK? - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.58,0:08:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果你没心情 我们可以离开 - 不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know, if you're not in the mood, we can go. - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.42,0:08:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 确定？- 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm fine. - Sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.33,0:09:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我带的足够多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! I brought enough for others to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.46,0:09:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 分手后我就经常自己煮饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - I've, been cooking a lot since the break-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.19,0:09:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔纳斯有段不幸福的婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonas has had a tough one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.83,0:09:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉很糟糕吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.35,0:09:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在筹备婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we were in the middle of planning is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.18,0:09:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我突然意识到如果这段婚礼对你来说意义越小\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I suddenly realised that the less the relationship means.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.87,0:09:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会越重视婚礼这个形式\N{\fnArial\fs30}the more you spend on the wedding, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开始挑剔每个细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}You actually start obsessing over the tiniest little details,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.15,0:09:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如请柬的的纸要多厚才合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}like the thickness of the wedding invitation paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.11,0:09:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 我是说 上帝才知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}because, I mean, God knows…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.30,0:09:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要一些可供谈论的话题\N{\fnArial\fs30}you need something to fucking talk about!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.04,0:09:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家 这是海伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, everybody, this is Helen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.71,0:09:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是乔纳斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helen, Jonas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.27,0:09:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是大家！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.78,0:09:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 请随意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi! - Help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.74,0:09:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔纳斯正在说明为什么婚姻是个骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonas was just explaining why relationships are a sham.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.64,0:09:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是骗子吗？太糟了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they? Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.99,0:09:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像你们去剧院\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're like going to the theatre, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.72,0:09:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,花了很多钱买票\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pay loads to go…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.99,0:10:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但最后却发现这完全是浪费\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ultimately you are wasting your entire night,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.72,0:10:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当有人问你们好看吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, when someone asks you, "Did you have a good time?",
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,却都说当然 当然 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you both say, "Yeah! Yeah, it was great."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.74,0:10:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以问题就是你花费的越多\N{\fnArial\fs30}The problem is the more that you pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.88,0:10:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,关系持续时间越长\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the longer it goes on,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.61,0:10:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,更多的当然 我们很喜欢就会出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}the more you're, "Yeah, we loved it!",
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.34,0:10:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我们喜欢在一起 不上其他任何人」\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, "We love being together and never fucking anyone else"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.21,0:10:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一生中 能有个人与你分享\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and only just having one other person"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.96,0:10:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼此真正的想法 太棒了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}"to share our real thoughts with for our entire lives, yeah, it's great!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.30,0:10:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样来说 你有爱过她吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you say you loved her, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.58,0:10:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能说我们真的喜欢对方 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just think we just really fancied each other and that was what it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.28,0:10:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道最开始我们是怎么样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what it's like early on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.72,0:10:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we were just, I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.84,0:10:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是两个在工具箱里的工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were just two tools in the tool shed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.00,0:10:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚好彼此合适罢了 正他妈的合适！\N{\fnArial\fs30}that just fit together really fucking well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.72,0:10:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,到最后的时候 我们就像是这样：\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, still, by the end, I'd be like,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你上去睡觉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Go on, honey, you go up, "
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.36,0:10:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还想再看一下新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'm just going to watch a little bit more of the news"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.56,0:10:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我其实是在看\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'd find myself, you know, watching redos of, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.16,0:10:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早年激情四射时的记忆回放\N{\fnArial\fs30}hot times in earlier relationships!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.28,0:10:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,淡定！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.32,0:10:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说 有一个漂亮女人正在楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying, there's a beautiful woman upstairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.04,0:11:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着和我做爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, waiting to have sex with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.38,0:11:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 现在就有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.18,0:11:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就在楼上 等着和我缠绵\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's upstairs, you know, waiting to have sex with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.32,0:11:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我却坐在楼下 回放那些激情时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm sat downstairs watching redos of, like, some hot times.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.60,0:11:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,和那些我都不知道在哪搭上的女孩的激情时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}with some hot girl that I just picked up in some place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.20,0:11:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是太圆满了！说真的 太圆满了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm fucking pulling myself off. I mean, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.84,0:11:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.72,0:11:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 兄弟们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.84,0:11:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都有记忆芯片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we all scroll through the Grain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.60,0:11:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,回味我们最激情的时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}rifling through our greatest hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.20,0:11:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,满足我们偶尔的肮脏小思想 当然要如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a little bit of filth now and then, surely?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.40,0:11:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.78,0:11:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦没装记忆芯片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helen doesn't have a Grain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.91,0:11:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.56,0:11:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为政治原因吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that a political thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 12个月前 它被盗走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I was gouged about 12 months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.12,0:11:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪！痛吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, was that painful?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.85,0:11:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Total agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.84,0:11:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在疼痛作用下 我其实不记得有多痛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But on the plus of that, I don't remember it that clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.64,0:11:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这里留了一个疤\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a scar on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.82,0:11:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能看一下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, can I…?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.76,0:12:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这感觉起来还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that feels quite nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.56,0:12:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对脑部没伤害 绝对没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no brain damage, clearly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.36,0:12:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能看得很清楚 所以没影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my sight held on fine, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.75,0:12:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 谁偷走了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, who took it then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.78,0:12:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人下了订单要买它 警察查出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stolen to order, as far as they could tell,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.76,0:12:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许卖给那些中国百万富翁\N{\fnArial\fs30}probably to some millionaire Chinese perve.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.68,0:12:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗？- 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really?! - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.98,0:12:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.25,0:12:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 里面所有记忆都没加密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and none of it was encrypted, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.48,0:12:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 全被看见了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, they saw the lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.75,0:12:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,被盗以后 我过了几天没有记忆芯片的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is, after I was gouged I didn't have one for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.88,0:12:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有几分喜欢那种日子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then just kind of, liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.73,0:12:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.96,0:12:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是很酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.04,0:12:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 因为越来越多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, because more people are…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说现在 选择摘掉记忆芯片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, now, right? Like, going Grainless?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.88,0:12:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢说大部分都是妓女\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe it's huge with hookers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.32,0:12:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无意冒犯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, no offence!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.12,0:12:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没事 没关系 当然 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, it's OK. Sure, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.84,0:13:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也觉得只约会一个男人很无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm pretty boring. One man is a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.56,0:13:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,终身一夫一妻制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serial monogamist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.00,0:13:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是一夫一妻制\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a serial monogamist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.36,0:13:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说我现在对我的玉米条很忠诚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm staying faithful to my cornflakes right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.69,0:13:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 这是个很有趣的选择 摘掉芯片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think it's an interesting choice, going Grainless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.68,0:13:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个勇敢的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a brave choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.24,0:13:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 但我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but I…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.08,0:13:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.64,0:13:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算回放一下在弗雷泽O的时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, I was going to play some redos from the Fraser O days.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.08,0:13:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那的最后一晚 压抑但有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuff from last night, depressing and fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.22,0:13:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 一半的自然记忆都是垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know half the organic memories you have a junk,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.68,0:13:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可信\N{\fnArial\fs30}just not trustworthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.02,0:13:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,科琳 在芯片开发部工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colleen works in Grain development.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.76,0:13:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上一半的人 都会被引导产生错误记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}With half the population you can implant false memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.85,0:13:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要做的只是问他们一些引导性的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}just by asking leading questions in therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.82,0:13:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如你可以让他们以为曾在某个商场迷过路\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can make people remember getting lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.73,0:13:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实他们根本没去过那个商场\N{\fnArial\fs30}in shopping malls they never visited,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.60,0:13:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者说为恋童癖的保姆感到烦恼\N{\fnArial\fs30}getting bothered by paedophile babysitters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.72,0:13:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实你根本没有保姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}they never had.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.53,0:14:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是觉得现在比较快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just happier now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.84,0:14:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 利亚姆 这真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, great, Liam, this has been, this has been really great…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.68,0:14:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真的希望 期待着再次见到你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}we really hope to look forward to seeing you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.41,0:14:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他期待再次见到你 这很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looks forward to seeing you again, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.37,0:14:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望期待着能再次见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hopes" to look forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.28,0:14:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真心希望期待着能再次见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We really hope to look forward to seeing you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.44,0:14:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是说场面话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's phoney.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.03,0:14:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.41,0:14:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pause it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.84,0:14:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,往回倒一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.04,0:14:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,放大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoom in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.16,0:14:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到没 那是个勾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, that's a tick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.72,0:14:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可能是V或者L\N{\fnArial\fs30}That could be a V or an L.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.28,0:14:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是勾！- 还可能是卍的第一笔呢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a tick! - Or the start of the swastika.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.69,0:14:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有可能是卍的第一笔 他们都是些怪胎！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's probably the start of the swastika, they were such pricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.97,0:14:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 和老朋友在一起 开心吗？- 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you have fun with the old gang? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.84,0:14:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和乔纳斯聊了很多吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}D'you speak to that Jonas much?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.99,0:14:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 并没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.60,0:14:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个二货 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a bit of a knob, ain't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:14:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点傻逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit of a dick?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:14:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔纳斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.40,0:15:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直在搞弄他的那些婚姻论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulling himself off to his own relationship theories.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.60,0:15:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真令人厌烦 他一直在散布那些婚姻论\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be such a drag, Jonas, putting it about!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.92,0:15:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他帮我解围的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when he protected me from those arseholes,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.64,0:15:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hey, come on, guys, "
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.48,0:15:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人回放评估这事不太好 兄弟们\N{\fnArial\fs30}"it's really not cool to redo another man's appraisals, dudes."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.60,0:15:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么邀请他来家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why invite him over?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.00,0:15:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.81,0:15:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是你想我邀请他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted me to invite him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.68,0:15:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可什么都没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.36,0:15:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说什么你都很捧场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were laughing at everything he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.92,0:15:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你邀请他的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You invited him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.44,0:15:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显 其实我不想要他来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was obvious I didn't want him to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.00,0:15:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好早 现在还很早\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only, it's early to call it a night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.20,0:15:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,想找个酒吧喝点酒吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do fancy a quick one down the pub?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.93,0:15:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to get back,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.24,0:15:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,去把我们的小宝贝朱迪从恋童癖的保姆手上救出来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}rescue Jodie from the paedophile babysitter!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.38,0:15:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.60,0:15:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不来我们家呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why don't you come back to ours,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.00,0:15:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝点夜啤酒什么的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a nightcap if you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.44,0:15:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.48,0:15:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显我其实不想他来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was obvious I didn't want him to come,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.53,0:15:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,只想礼貌性的问一下那个呆瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was being polite to a moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.86,0:16:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真的不想 你可以把他弄走\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you really don't want to come, you can get rid of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.50,0:16:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 现在几点了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, actually, what time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.73,0:16:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,午夜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.23,0:16:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,都已经这么晚了 时间过得真快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, it's quite late, time's gone on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.33,0:16:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 时间不等人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, time does that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.48,0:16:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然这么快就过了15分钟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.72,0:16:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们保姆还在家里 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we've got the babysitter inside, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.88,0:16:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有新情况？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, is that new info?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.72,0:16:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们只是认为她应该还在 对吧 斐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's just that we, I mean, we thought, right, Fi?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.00,0:16:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.80,0:16:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, no, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.16,0:16:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是 因为我们都非常累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's just that, actually, it turns out we're tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.28,0:16:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以把保姆在的事儿给忘了 突然想起来 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I guess we forgot, but now we've remembered, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.68,0:16:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.36,0:16:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没事 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's fine, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.20,0:16:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.24,0:16:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cool, no worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有后备计划呢！所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a back-up plan, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.68,0:16:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 太好了 我们支持你的后备计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool, well, we vote the back-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.44,0:16:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.88,0:16:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,回见 斐\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you later, Fi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.64,0:16:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,认识你很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was good to meet you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.80,0:16:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.24,0:17:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,相处很愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.28,0:17:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 太妙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brilliant. Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.88,0:17:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 呵呵\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.04,0:17:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,认识你真高兴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to meet you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.48,0:17:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.83,0:17:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉娜 等出租车要40分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Gina, it's a 40-minute wait for a cab, but if you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的办公房里有铺好的床 你可以留下来休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the bed made up in my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.98,0:17:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, thanks, Fi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.97,0:17:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,要用什么就拿 有T恤还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there's just, you know, use anything. There's T-shirts and…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.09,0:17:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, thanks, I'll show myself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.98,0:17:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 你们晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - Night, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.00,0:17:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Night, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.04,0:17:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 吉娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Night, Gina.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.60,0:17:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.98,0:17:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.48,0:17:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱你 爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love you, love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.95,0:18:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是你们朋友中的中心人物吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was he a big part of the gang?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.32,0:18:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁？- 乔纳斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - Jonas?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.32,0:18:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.43,0:18:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 他一定经常在女孩身边打转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess, he'd spent his time oozing round the girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.32,0:18:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 献殷勤什么的 - 不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- offering backrubs. - Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.68,0:18:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再乘机下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Circling for an orifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.64,0:18:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一直这么油腔滑调还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was he always that oily or…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.12,0:18:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.54,0:18:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.80,0:18:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实没什么 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.88,0:18:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能也察觉到了 就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may have noticed a bit of an atmosphere because…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.59,0:18:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前 我和乔纳斯曾经约会过\N{\fnArial\fs30}me and Jonas, years ago, had a bit of a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.12,0:18:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和那个油腻男约会过？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a thing with oily dude man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.28,0:18:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这又不是什么大不了的事！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just a little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.36,0:18:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至都不知道你那时回来发展了 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I didn't even know you back then, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.88,0:18:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和他睡过了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You slept with oily dude man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.41,0:18:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是太滑稽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's hilarious!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.68,0:18:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你和姬玛呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've all got our skeletons, how about you and Gemma?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.36,0:18:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？我和你说过姬玛！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, I told you about Gemma.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.96,0:18:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个疯子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gemma was a nutcase…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.31,0:19:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你从没提过乔纳斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you never mentioned Jonas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.37,0:19:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过 我告诉过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did, I told you…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.75,0:19:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在马拉喀什的时候和一个男人约会过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hooked up with someone in Marrakech.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.25,0:19:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他就是马拉喀什那个？- 这是我做的蠢事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jonas is Mr Marrakesh?! - It was a stupid thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.69,0:19:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本以为马拉喀什那男的会是个超级有魅力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought Mr Marrakech was some sort of super cool…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.72,0:19:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正不是他这种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.76,0:19:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都过了好多年了 再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was years ago and…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.92,0:19:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会因为这事很窘迫吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you embarrassed by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.32,0:19:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这的确让人尴尬！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cos it's embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.95,0:19:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 但你尴尬吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but, Christ, are you not embarrassed?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.09,0:19:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是很多年前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.57,0:19:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你和他约会了一个月？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you dated him for a month?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.33,0:19:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.53,0:19:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当时你和我说马拉喀什的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cos when you told me about Mr Marrakech,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.24,0:19:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的是一星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.56,0:19:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.16,0:19:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.37,0:19:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在不想看我们的第一次！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to see our first time right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.65,0:19:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你马上要说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Syou're about to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.73,0:19:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我离开了 头脑发热的了一阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went away and had a little thing that did my head in for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.89,0:19:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一个一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}with this, sort of…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.01,0:19:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一个在马拉喀什的傻子在一起了一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}this, sort of, headfuck that I met in Marrakech.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.57,0:19:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,马拉喀什先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Marrakech?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.89,0:19:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 可以这么叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.21,0:19:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想 他一定有一个大钢炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm imagining a chillum and a big knob.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.60,0:20:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 其实是小牙刷\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it was like dormouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.69,0:20:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这段感情对你来说重要吗 伤透了心？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big deal, big heart-breaker?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.53,0:20:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 才一个星期而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it was just a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.09,0:20:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪异的一个星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a weird week.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.29,0:20:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一星期还是一个月？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, a weird week or a month?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.35,0:20:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,重点是 这段感情不是那么重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point is, it wasn't a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.18,0:20:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,足够重要了 让你头脑发热\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it was big enough to do your head in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.05,0:20:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔纳斯 马拉喀什的微型小鸡鸡让你头脑发热了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonas, King Dormouse-Dick of Marrakech did your head in!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.21,0:20:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来那是个很美好的夜晚 至少曾经是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a nice night, used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.69,0:20:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死磕上了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're getting obsessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.05,0:20:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没有 - 你原来对丹的事也这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not. - We had all this with Dan,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.09,0:20:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你别再这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you going like that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.61,0:20:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹他有一双惊悚的水泡小眼睛 他还经常\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had little creepy beady eyes and he was always…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.41,0:20:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么？表现得好像他自己很有趣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Acting like he was interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.41,0:20:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我觉得他可能的确喜欢我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what, I think he probably did fancy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.57,0:20:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他哪有那么可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}and actually he wasn't completely hideous,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.65,0:20:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算有时候是很可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}so in another life I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.57,0:20:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我和他之间没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}but nothing happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.65,0:20:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于乔纳斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Jonas…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.29,0:20:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的前炮友 那又怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's an old fling. So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.67,0:20:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,别扯在一起说！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go all fucked up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.09,0:20:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？我搞砸的？- 不 我的意思是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What, I'm fucked up, am I? - No, I mean, just…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:20:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的太妙了 有时你真他妈是个婊子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, that's brilliant, sometimes you're a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.74,0:21:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.05,0:21:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个婊子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.30,0:21:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你把它删了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like you to erase that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.17,0:21:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个婊子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.25,0:21:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面还说了「有时候」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, "sometimes".
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.40,0:21:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能断章取义！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just edit off the word, "sometimes"!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.57,0:21:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 斐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Fi,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.84,0:22:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道有时候自己像个蠢货又情绪无常\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I go a bit weird and wonky sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.69,0:22:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱你 你知道的 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love you, you know? - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.09,0:23:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在工具箱里的工具刚好彼此合适罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a toolshed that just fit together really fucking well,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.62,0:23:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就像是这样：\N{\fnArial\fs30}but still by the end I'd be like,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.45,0:23:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 上去睡觉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Go, on, you go to bed, honey,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.37,0:23:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还想再看一下新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'm just going to catch a little bit more of the news, "
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.57,0:23:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我是在看…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I'd find myself, you know, watching redos of hot times…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.41,0:23:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,早年激情四射时的记忆回放\N{\fnArial\fs30}in earlier relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.10,0:23:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个漂亮女人正在楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a beautiful woman upstairs waiting to have sex with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.45,0:23:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我其实是在看\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'd find myself, you know, watching redos of…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.01,0:23:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早年激情四射时的记忆回放\N{\fnArial\fs30}hot times in earlier relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.93,0:23:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,淡定！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.10,0:24:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,唇语读取重现功能已激活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lip read reconstruction enabled.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.52,0:24:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 见到你很高兴 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, it's good to see you. - Good to see you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.66,0:24:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到说你要来的时候我还很紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was nervous when I heard you were going to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.24,0:24:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有点怪异 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's weird, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.55,0:24:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早安 - 吉娜 来这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morning. - Gina, over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.99,0:24:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来一下 我需要你的意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here a second. I just want your opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.36,0:24:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在做点傻事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a silly game.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.85,0:24:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.50,0:24:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.47,0:24:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是一夫一妻制\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a serial monogamist.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.21,0:24:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说我现在对我的玉米条很忠诚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm staying faithful to my corn flakes right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.64,0:24:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得 好笑吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, is that funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.61,0:24:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要说好话 这人是个傻逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no need to be nice, the man's a prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.88,0:24:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这好笑吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that funny, in your opinion?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.06,0:24:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.44,0:24:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是一夫一妻制\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a serial monogamist.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.09,0:24:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说我现在对我的玉米条很忠诚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm staying faithful to my corn flakes right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.59,0:25:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不好笑？- 不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.95,0:25:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. - You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.28,0:25:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.41,0:25:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.09,0:25:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是再问吉娜对此的意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just getting Gina's opinion on something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.52,0:25:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一夫一妻制者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a serial monogamist.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.67,0:25:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说我现在对我的玉米条很忠诚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm staying faithful to my corn flakes right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.40,0:25:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会有疑问是因为你觉得这很好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just wondering because you found it funny,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.94,0:25:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其实不好笑 吉娜也这么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it isn't, and Gina agrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.85,0:25:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的不想卷进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't really want to get involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.31,0:25:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮你叫个出租车吧 - 我爸快来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me get you a cab. - My dad's on his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.44,0:25:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,只还需要问你一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one other thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.11,0:25:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都想他来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both want him to come back,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.10,0:25:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但谁更想他来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}but who wants him to come back more?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.89,0:25:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,认真思考一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your opinion, off the top of your head,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.41,0:25:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为谁更想他来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}who wants him to come back more?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.36,0:25:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, well, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.84,0:25:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.85,0:25:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好早 现在还很早\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's early. It's early to call it a night.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.27,0:25:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想找个酒吧喝一杯吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fancy a quick one down the pub?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.45,0:25:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to get back,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.40,0:25:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,把小宝贝朱迪从恋童癖的保姆手上救出来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}rescue Jodie from the paedophile baby-sitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.36,0:25:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是个 只是个玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just a… That's a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.07,0:25:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.56,0:25:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔纳斯 为什么不来我们家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonas, why don't you come back to ours…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.64,0:25:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝点啤酒什么的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a nightcap, if you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.00,0:25:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.67,0:26:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在意这个玩笑 谁更想他来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, ignore the joke. Who's more keen for him to come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.29,0:26:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.72,0:26:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 吉娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do know, Gina.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.20,0:26:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 他酒还没醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, he's really hungover.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.13,0:26:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.40,0:26:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说我现在对我的玉米条很忠诚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm staying faithful to my corn flakes right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.76,0:26:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,客观来说 这一点也不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is just objectively not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.62,0:26:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都会说这并不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone would say, "That's not funny."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.67,0:26:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这他妈太让人尴尬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was fucking embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.52,0:26:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你还要干什么 停止！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you're queuing up, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.04,0:26:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.20,0:26:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见了没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.20,0:26:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识杰夫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know Geoff?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.14,0:26:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会记得我和杰夫是因为他给你看过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you remember me and Geoff, because he would have shown you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.46,0:27:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于他电冰箱侧面的一个回放 诸如此类\N{\fnArial\fs30}a re-do of the side of his fridge, something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.74,0:27:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说说有什么不同 - 你醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Spot the difference. - You're drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.80,0:27:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是那个不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.24,0:27:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对待他时 好像他是世界上最好的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the greatest guy in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.88,0:27:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一来 你就沉默了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I arrived and… you clam.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.99,0:27:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,再看一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}For clarity.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.49,0:27:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们那时只是在说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.92,0:27:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但就在几秒钟后 你一下子僵住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But moments later, you're so stiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.96,0:27:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, a re-do…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.50,0:27:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都不知道该怎么呆在他周围\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know how to stand around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.64,0:27:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直在计量着 表现也忽冷忽热\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your gauges are all over the place, hot and cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.08,0:27:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太蠢了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.52,0:27:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你掩饰不了 至少不能完全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't hide it. Not completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.63,0:27:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你是怎么看着他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See how you look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.68,0:27:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这段婚礼对你来说意义越小\N{\fnArial\fs30}The less the relationship means,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.78,0:27:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会越重视婚礼这个形式\N{\fnArial\fs30}the more you spend on the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.75,0:27:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开始挑剔每个细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, you start obsessing about these tiny little details.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.18,0:27:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如请柬的的纸要多厚才合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}like the thickness of the wedding invitation paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.10,0:27:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你是怎么看着我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, how you look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.28,0:27:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个很有趣的选择 摘掉芯片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's an interesting choice, going grainless.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.36,0:27:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个勇敢的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a brave choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.68,0:27:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.68,0:27:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,说你其实是像看他那样看着我 你说不出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you look at me nice like you look at him. You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.24,0:27:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我是怎样看着你的呢 利亚姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how am I looking at you now, Liam?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.08,0:27:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底和他在一起了多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long did you go out with him for?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.36,0:28:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很重要吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.44,0:28:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？一半的自然记忆都是垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, half the organic memories you have are junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.00,0:28:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可信 当遇到小事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just not trustworthy. When it comes to little things.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.82,0:28:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,和大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And big ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.92,0:28:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是在马拉喀什吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that Marrakesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.16,0:28:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这看起来像是在马拉喀什吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that look like Marrakesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.92,0:28:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.40,0:28:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是在马拉喀什\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not Marrakesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.71,0:28:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你和他在一起有多久了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how long did you go out with him for?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.63,0:28:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 大约6个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, about six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.31,0:28:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以不是一星期或者一个月 而是6个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}So not a week or a month. Six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.41,0:28:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真是永不消逝的电波\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ever-inflating romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.57,0:28:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能现在还和他搞着呢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're probably still going out with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.52,0:28:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要在这里接受你的拷问？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I on trial here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.77,0:28:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你和他是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's been going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.20,0:28:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在和他没什么事！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing has been going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.28,0:28:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是… 你知道是什么样的 和一个人上床\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was… Christ, you know how it is when you first get with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.98,0:29:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,前男友的问题就会跑出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then previous boyfriends come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.04,0:29:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是什么男朋友 他是你所说的怪异一星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was never a boyfriend, he was always a weird week.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.34,0:29:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本不看重 所以我蒙混过去了 它只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I downplayed it. I fudged it, it was…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.81,0:29:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.69,0:29:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是所有的事情都撒谎 利亚姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not everything that isn't true is a lie, Liam.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.68,0:29:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在说什么？- 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Yeah, allright!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.59,0:29:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他在一起是比我原先说的长久\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he was a bigger thing than I made out and,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.11,0:29:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 他是有点傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah, he's sort of a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.48,0:29:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点？他是个巨傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of? He's a massive…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.88,0:29:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那时喜欢着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I liked him then.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.68,0:29:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不喜欢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't like him,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.00,0:29:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指 不是情人那种喜欢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}not like that, not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.07,0:29:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们把事情搞清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, just to get this clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.02,0:29:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他上了你 往他的个人猎艳记录里加上一笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}He fucks you, gets footage for his redo wank file,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.83,0:29:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却还和他很亲密！\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're still pally.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.79,0:29:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说太糟糕了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.79,0:29:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为如果他 - 这一切太糟糕了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cos if he was… - This is just sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.78,0:29:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能正坐在那里 盖着羊毛毯\N{\fnArial\fs30}He probably sits there and tosses himself.
