Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.18,0:29:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这已经是很久以前的事了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.48,0:29:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他来说可不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.00,0:29:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我其实是在看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd find myself watching redos of really hot times.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.47,0:29:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早年激情四射时的记忆回放\N{\fnArial\fs30}early in relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.41,0:29:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,淡定！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.44,0:29:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,清醒一点 去吐一下你就酒醒了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sober up. Make yourself puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.88,0:29:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者顺便你要怎么做 我不管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever, I don't care. Just sort this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.43,0:29:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.12,0:30:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我其实是在看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd find myself watching redos of really hot times.
