Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.60,0:30:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就在楼上 等着和我缠绵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, nice, Geoff. She's upstairs waiting to have sex with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.08,0:30:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我却坐在楼下 回放那些激情时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm downstairs watching some redo.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.76,0:30:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,和那些我都不知道在哪搭上的女孩的激情时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}of some night I've picked up somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.92,0:30:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,淡定！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.52,0:30:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是太圆满了！说真的 太圆满了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm fucking pulling myself off. I'm just saying.
