Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.28,0:30:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,芯片助手提醒你 你现在的身体状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grain assistant suggests you may not be in a suitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.03,0:30:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不适合做现在的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}physical condition for the activity you appear to be engaged in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.57,0:30:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果置之不理的话 你会有生命危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}To override, continue at your own risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.12,0:30:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以的健康和意外保险都\N{\fnArial\fs30}All health and personal accident insurance is…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.10,0:30:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是谢谢你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.00,0:31:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁啊？- 利亚姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's that? - It's Liam.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.75,0:31:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们昨晚刚见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liam from last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.09,0:31:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,利亚姆 斐和你一起的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liam. Is Fi with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.12,0:31:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 没\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.80,0:31:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 但你有什么事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Liam, mate, is there something that you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.26,0:31:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我想和你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I just want to come in and talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.68,0:31:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,能把门打开吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you open the gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.88,0:31:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, sure. - I'll let you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.50,0:31:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice one, nice one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.12,0:31:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.52,0:31:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是想进来看看 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to come in for a bit, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.48,0:31:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这看起来很豪华 很贵吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That looks expensive. Is that expensive?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.06,0:31:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,利亚姆 现在还是早上 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Liam, it's morning, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.92,0:31:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的 利亚姆！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking hell. Liam.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.71,0:32:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔纳斯 这儿真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonas, this is a nice place!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.47,0:32:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 你就这样走进来可不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Seriously, man, it's not cool you just walking in like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.00,0:32:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,准确的说 是有点奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be honest with you, it's a little bit weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.46,0:32:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个马拉喀什台灯吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a Marrakeshian lamp?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.50,0:32:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,利亚姆 需要我打给斐吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liam, do I have to call Fi?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.15,0:32:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们吵架了还是怎么的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you guys have a row or something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.48,0:32:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坐下 - 不 我站着很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sit down. - No, I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.63,0:32:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快坐下吧 又不是有陷阱 只是把椅子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, sit down. It's not a bear trap, it's a chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.71,0:32:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想我用这个砸你的傻逼头吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want me to bounce this off your fucking head?
