Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.11,0:33:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要点精彩图像粘贴到剪贴板上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some good stuff for the scrapbook?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.15,0:33:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.80,0:33:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会怪你的 虽然我本应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't blame you. I would have.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.44,0:33:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 让我们看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you what, let's have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.62,0:33:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,来嘛 在这屏幕上放一下 别害羞！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, chuck it on the screen, don't be shy!
